WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
Your right hand in your left hand.

2
00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:04.880
And you're going to place it like a sword there,

3
00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:05.410
in your belly.

4
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:06.930
Right here, just like that.

5
00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:08.730
To have control here over the hara.

6
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.110
And you're going to start by breathing into your

7
00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:12.550
belly.

8
00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:15.300
So I'm going to inhale, I'm going to exhale through

9
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:15.940
my mouth, like this.

10
00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:25.290
I hold my breath for 10 seconds, on the exhale.

11
00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:33.425
And then, I inhale like that.

12
00:00:48.775 --> 00:00:51.155
Now, you need to practice this exercise 3 times,

13
00:00:51.195 --> 00:00:51.995
then 30 times.

14
00:00:53.735 --> 00:00:55.175
You'll need to increase over time.

15
00:00:55.215 --> 00:00:56.535
You can increase. up to

16
00:01:00.331 --> 00:01:01.951
one to two minutes without breathing.

